# Media files (demo .mp4 / .webm recordings) are NOT stored in this repository.
#
# They used to be tracked through Git LFS, but the objects were never uploaded to
# the LFS store, so every clone (Render, CI, contributors) failed at checkout with
# "smudge filter lfs failed" / "Object does not exist on the server: [404]".
#
# Keep large recordings out of git entirely; the in-README demo GIFs in assets/
# are tracked as ordinary files and are small enough to clone normally.
